commit 0b98c2725368023c27e8f29066a7f9322f4630af
Author: stilnat <nathan.raynal.castang@gmail.com>
Date:   2021-10-02 11:38:15 +0200

    New Container Editor, multiple container on a single game object (#798)
    
    Simplifies adding a container to a game object, as the current system is over complicated for contributors. All relevant container parameters, such as it's type, it's size, if it displays objects, and more, are in a single script, containerDescriptor.
    This script has a custom editor that allows contributors to build a container in a coherent manner.

